<title>USA: Continental Airlines March load factor up.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines March load factor up.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		  1996</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  74.5		72.2</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	     4,106	     3,685</p>
<p> Available seat miles		  5,512	     5,106</p>
<p> Total cargo ton miles	  46,012,000	40,566,000</p>
<p>					    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  68.8		67.0</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	    10,894	     9,756</p>
<p> Available seat miles		 15,836	    14,564</p>
